      "category": "Text",
      "text": "c. Any contracting agency taking any enforcement or investigatory action authorized by this Executive Order, whether on its own motion, or as directed by the City Administrator, or under the rules and regulations of the City Administrator, shall promptly notify the City Administrator of such action. Whenever the City Administrator makes a determination provided for in this Executive Order, he shall promptly notify the appropriate contracting agency, together with his recommendation or direction for the action to be taken by such contracting agency in compliance therewith. The contracting agency shall take such action, and shall report the results thereof to the City Administrator, within such time as the City Administrator shall specify.",
